    "body": "This either needs element to be a HTMLElement (or child of), or some of the spec will need updating as currently popover invoker is an HTMLElement (see https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#popover-invoker)\r\n\r\ntogglePopover isn't quite a simple addition because of the optional force boolean argument. We'd have to either take the compat hit of changing the argument type, or do the slightly unfortunate thing of allowing an argument of type boolean or dict where the dict has invoker and force as optional members.",
